    "desktop.gestures.help" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gestures\n• One finger: tap = click; two quick taps = double-click (e.g. title-bar zoom); slide = move; hold ~200ms then drag = select text\n• Two fingers: scroll (trackpad direction); pinch = zoom view; long-press = right-click\n• Three fingers: swipe left/right = switch Mac Spaces (including fullscreen apps)\nWhen zoomed in, one-finger drag pans the picture; pinch back to 1× to control the mouse again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手势说明\n• 单指：轻点=单击；连点两次=双击（如标题栏缩放窗口）；滑动=移动光标；按住约 200ms 再拖=选中文字\n• 双指：滚动（与触控板同向）；捏合=缩放画面；长按=右键\n• 三指：左右滑=切换 Mac 桌面空间（含全屏 App）\n放大画面后，单指拖动为平移画面；捏合回 1× 后可再控制鼠标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "desktop.quality.res.mismatch" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
